      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "613bbc50dbd6a303717913af",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Please add OVRLipSync's laughter detection to 3.0 avatars! 🙏\n----\nVRChat uses OVRLipSync for visemes (as far as I know)\nhttps://developer.oculus.com/documentation/unity/audio-ovrlipsync-unity/\nCurrently we're unable to use OVRLipSync's laughter detection (available in versions 1.30.0 and newer).\nI'm sure we all love to laugh with (and at) our friends in VRChat. It would be amazing if we could use laughter detection for our 3.0 avatars! 😄",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Laughter detection (OVRLipSync)",
