      "value": "Was about to make a new feature request, when I saw this was already posted and merged with another.\n\nWould love to see this updated to be included in the base game.  Its really nice to use in Resonite with how much life it adds by being able to express laughter naturally without needing to remember to use a specific gesture in the moment.\n\nCurrently working on tiny OSC program using OVRLipSync just to so I can use the laugh parameter in VRC.\n\nHope this gets more visibility and makes it into the game officially!!",
